  "description": "The Aspire Gotek X is a truly unique vape kit designed for ease of use, portability and immensely satisfying and flavoursome MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping with the option to enjoy RDTL (restricted-direct-to-lung) vaping with the aid of an adjustable airflow control. The Aspire Gotek X is a futuristic pod kit with a striking translucent chassis that hints at the advanced Aspire ASP chipset inside. The Gotek X is also one of the most compact and lightweight all-in-one pod kits Aspire have ever made, and at barely the size of a matchbox the Gotek X is a great choice for vapers who want a simple kit that can slip easily into any pocket or compartment, or go hands free with the help of the included lanyard holder. The Aspire Gotek X Pro pod kit contains a 650mAh internal battery, enough to last most vapers a full day of use and can be charged via fast Type-C charging in less than an hour. Aspire’s advanced ASP chipset provides several safety protections including protection against overcharge, overcharge and short circuits. Using the Aspire Gotek X is as simple as taking a puff on the pod’s mouthpiece. The pod itself contains 2ml of your favourite e-liquid and can be refilled simply and cleanly using the side-fill port. The pod contains an integrated 0.8ohm AF mesh coils that delivers exceptional flavour with the Gotek X’s max power output of 13W. The Aspire Gotek X is perfect for use with nic salt , 50/50 and classic High-PG e-liquids. in rare instances, charging your Aspire Gotek-X device with the pods attached may temporarily result in a diminished or burnt taste. For this reason we recommend charging your device with the pods removed, then reattach them once the device is fully charged. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. Please Note: This Kit Dose Not Come With A USB Charging Cable. A USB-C Charging Cabel can be purchased separately.",
